785	 * {@link EnsureUniqueIdentity}) but still shares an existing owner's
786	 * {@link HouseholdNormalizer#id(String, String) household id} (same last name and postcode) while
787	 * giving a different telephone. Such a request is allowed but marked for follow-up: the built
