789	 * owner's id (the earliest match when several exist). A <em>declared</em> household member (the
790	 * request set {@code sharesHousehold}) is never flagged — deliberately sharing a household is not a
791	 * suspected duplicate. When nothing matches, {@code possibleDuplicate} is false and
792	 * {@code possibleDuplicateOf} stays absent. Runs before {@link SaveOwner}, so the new owner is not
793	 * yet persisted and is never matched against itself. Mutates the built {@link Owner} in place.
794	 */
